come to the PropertyList Community!</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9a6f448 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"9a6f448\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d57a7cb elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"d57a7cb\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"512\" height=\"512\" src=\"https://info.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/cropped-PropertyList-green-ICON.png\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-13179\" alt=\"PropertyList.es - The 1st FREE MLS for Estate Agents.\" srcset=\"https://info.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/cropped-PropertyList-green-ICON.png 512w, https://info.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/cropped-PropertyList-green-ICON-300x300.png 300w, https://info.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/cropped-PropertyList-green-ICON-150x150.png 150w, https://info.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/cropped-PropertyList-green-ICON-20x20.png 20w, https://info.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/cropped-PropertyList-green-ICON-32x32.png 32w, https://info.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/cropped-PropertyList-green-ICON-70x70.png 70w, https://info.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/cropped-PropertyList-green-ICON-16x16.png 16w, https://info.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/cropped-PropertyList-green-ICON-40x40.png 40w, https://info.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/cropped-PropertyList-green-ICON-50x50.png 50w, https://info.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/cropped-PropertyList-green-ICON-12x12.png 12w, https://info.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/cropped-PropertyList-green-ICON-60x60.png 60w, https://info.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/cropped-PropertyList-green-ICON-18x18.png 18w, https://info.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/cropped-PropertyList-green-ICON-270x270.png 270w, https://info.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/cropped-PropertyList-green-ICON-192x192.png 192w, https://info.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/cropped-PropertyList-green-ICON-180x180.png 180w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 512px) 100vw, 512px\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7433c15 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"7433c15\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3><strong>What is PropertyList?</strong></h3><p><strong>PropertyList</strong> is a comprehensive real estate platform that offers free listings, users, branded microsites, CRM and other tools to efficiently list, manage, and market properties, with additional paid features available for enhanced functionalities. Pay as you go with no monthly subscriptions.</p><p>This manual provides detailed instructions and information on all aspects of the platform, from <a href=\"/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/listing-a-property/import-properties/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">importing your properties</a> to <a href=\"https://info.propertylist.es/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/pipeline-tracking/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">managing sales pipeline</a>,<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.15px; text-align: var(--text-align); color: var(--p_color);\"> a comprehensive guide to using the PropertyList MLS platform.</span></p><p><strong>Who should use this manual?</strong></p><p>This manual is intended for all users of the PropertyList MLS platform. Whether you are a new user or an experienced user, you will find helpful information in this manual. We&#8217;re always working on new features to help estate agents close more deals and save time. Keep an eye out for upcoming updates and features!</p><p><strong>What is included in this manual?</strong></p><p>This manual includes the following information:</p><ul><li><a href=\"/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/listing-a-property/creating-a-new-listing/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Creating and managing listings</strong></a></li><li><a href=\"https://info.propertylist.es/docs/propertylist-advanced-user-manual/how-to-manage-your-leads/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Managing leads</strong></a></li><li><a href=\"/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/pipeline-tracking/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Using the Client Pipeline</strong></a></li><li><a href=\"/docs/propertylist-advanced-user-manual/how-to-use-the-calendar/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Using the PropertyList Calendar</strong></a></li><li><a href=\"/docs/property-portal-manual/reports-and-statistics/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Generating reports and statistics</strong></a></li><li><a href=\"/forums/forum/employment-opportunities/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Posting Job Opportunities</strong></a></li><li><a href=\"/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/additional-resources/\"><strong>Additional resources</strong></a></li></ul><p><strong>How to use this manual</strong></p><p>This manual is organised into a series of chapters and sections, you can find sections on the left of all document pages. Each chapter covers a different topic, and each section provides detailed instructions on a specific task. You can use the search function to find the exact information you need.</p><p>We hope you find this manual helpful. If you have any questions, please contact <a href=\"https://info.propertylist.es/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/additional-resources/mls-support/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">PropertyList support</a>.</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7f540c9 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"7f540c9\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1734\" height=\"671\" data-src=\"https://info.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/Screenshot_20231212_115722_Drive.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-10180 lazyload\" alt=\"PropertyList\" data-srcset=\"https://info.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/Screenshot_20231212_115722_Drive.jpg 1734w, https://info.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/Screenshot_20231212_115722_Drive-300x116.jpg 300w, https://info.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/Screenshot_20231212_115722_Drive-1024x396.jpg 1024w, https://info.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/Screenshot_20231212_115722_Drive-768x297.jpg 768w, https://info.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/Screenshot_20231212_115722_Drive-20x8.jpg 20w, https://info.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/Screenshot_20231212_115722_Drive-32x12.jpg 32w, https://info.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/Screenshot_20231212_115722_Drive-1536x594.jpg 1536w, https://info.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/Screenshot_20231212_115722_Drive-600x232.jpg 600w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 1734px) 100vw, 1734px\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAAAAACH5BAEKAAEALAAAAAABAAEAAAICTAEAOw==\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 1734px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 1734/671;\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t</div>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t<div class=\"details_cont ent recently_added\" id=\"content_elements\"><h4 class=\"c_head\">Articles</h4><ul class=\"article_list\"><li class=\"page_item page-item-10098\"><a href=\"https://info.propertylist.es/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/g